WEBVTT

00:05.650 --> 00:09.530
When you finish loading your supplies,
get in your boats and go on standby!

00:14.520 --> 00:15.660
I'm coming too!

00:15.660 --> 00:18.320
Nibi, you weren't chosen.

00:18.320 --> 00:19.790
Stay here and protect the others.

00:19.790 --> 00:22.410
No way. I've had enough of being left behind!

00:24.870 --> 00:27.620
Nibi, while I appreciate your enthusiasm—

00:27.620 --> 00:30.130
Shut up! This has nothing to do with the damn SDF!

00:30.130 --> 00:31.660
Calm down!

00:33.960 --> 00:36.640
Hey, don't you hear something?

00:37.990 --> 00:40.330
There's something besides the sandstorm.

00:40.330 --> 00:41.100
What?

00:47.800 --> 00:48.940
They're here.

00:48.940 --> 00:50.940
The enemy is right in front of us!

02:37.570 --> 02:38.470
It's Skylos!

02:46.410 --> 02:50.350
We are approaching Falaina's course on schedule.

02:52.960 --> 02:55.760
Will this disturbance eventually quiet down?

02:55.760 --> 03:00.070
Unknown. It appears to be a meteorological phenomenon unique to these sands.

03:00.520 --> 03:03.700
The cause is reportedly prehistoric remains near the ocean floor.

03:04.550 --> 03:09.360
Shall we send a messenger to Commander Orka of the Carcharias, Commander Araphne?

03:09.360 --> 03:10.080
No.

03:12.000 --> 03:15.500
There's no need to inform him of such a trivial obstacle.

03:16.790 --> 03:19.590
Full speed ahead. Lay alongside Falaina.

03:19.910 --> 03:22.300
Roger. Skylos, full speed.

03:29.520 --> 03:30.940
Full speed.

04:10.050 --> 04:18.270
God in heaven, I thank you for blessing me with this abundance of wonderful friends.

04:18.740 --> 04:22.650
My friends... laugh and cry to your hearts' content!

04:23.690 --> 04:27.160
Be filled with fear and anger!

04:27.880 --> 04:34.750
And then show me the best dying faces you can!

04:43.690 --> 04:45.970
Everyone, set sail!

04:52.330 --> 04:53.680
Get on board, Nibi.

07:25.490 --> 07:27.380
Begin the counterattack!

07:32.380 --> 07:33.510
Fire!

07:54.820 --> 07:55.490
Got him!

07:55.490 --> 07:57.330
Wow, that was so cool!

07:57.330 --> 07:58.040
You got it!

07:58.040 --> 07:59.500
Awesome!

08:23.250 --> 08:24.700
Take their weapons!

08:31.660 --> 08:33.330
Back inside, hurry!

08:35.410 --> 08:37.410
Hurry! As fast as you can!

08:39.250 --> 08:41.500
Found you!

08:56.550 --> 09:01.270
Come on out! I wanna play with you!

09:04.330 --> 09:06.230
Master Suou!

09:06.790 --> 09:08.290
What is that?

09:08.290 --> 09:10.050
We picked it up.

09:10.050 --> 09:10.820
This is...

09:13.230 --> 09:15.340
Please use it to defend yourself.

09:15.340 --> 09:16.930
Let's go get more!

09:16.930 --> 09:17.320
Sure!

09:18.340 --> 09:19.340
Wait!

09:46.240 --> 09:47.730
Master Suou!

09:48.650 --> 09:50.230
What's wrong?

09:50.880 --> 09:52.940
Are you okay, Master Suou?

10:10.790 --> 10:13.300
Good girl. That was some nice climbing.

10:14.280 --> 10:15.840
This is the entrance.

10:29.090 --> 10:30.790
<i>So this is Skylos.</i>

10:35.210 --> 10:36.740
It's made from mud.

10:45.680 --> 10:51.450
<i>Both Skylos and Lykos's ship have the same smell as the Mud Whale.</i>

10:52.800 --> 10:59.200
<i>That's right. The hearts of the Empire's citizens I saw on Lykos's ship, and the world Neri showed me,</i>

10:59.990 --> 11:02.340
<i>all filled me with this same nostalgia.</i>

11:02.810 --> 11:05.830
<i>So why is it that we must do this?</i>

11:06.550 --> 11:07.680
Chakuro!

11:12.350 --> 11:13.680
Chakuro, get down!

11:28.160 --> 11:29.450
Let's do this!

11:29.450 --> 11:30.580
Yeah!

11:31.330 --> 11:32.290
Reporting in.

11:33.370 --> 11:36.720
The guards have encountered intruders in the underground passage.

11:36.720 --> 11:39.000
They are believed to be from Falaina.

11:39.000 --> 11:42.510
They came just as we expected. Their goal is likely...

11:42.510 --> 11:44.800
Our nous, I would presume.

11:44.800 --> 11:47.560
Yes. What of Commander-in-Chief Orka's sister?

11:48.090 --> 11:50.950
We have confirmed that she is
accompanying the enemy forces.

11:50.950 --> 11:53.720
She appears to be leading them to the nous.

11:53.720 --> 11:54.520
Let's capture her.

11:55.040 --> 11:57.680
That would be in accordance with Commander Orka's orders.

11:58.530 --> 12:00.920
We should be able to swiftly annihilate them.

12:01.820 --> 12:04.410
Kill Orka's sister as well.

12:06.770 --> 12:08.080
S-Sir...

12:36.940 --> 12:38.940
Don't get distracted.

12:38.940 --> 12:40.830
This isn't the Mud Whale.

12:41.440 --> 12:44.030
Intruders, answer our questions.

12:44.390 --> 12:46.080
What is your identity?

12:48.330 --> 12:52.910
Answer. Are you the daimons of Falaina—

13:07.900 --> 13:09.220
Damn, son!

13:09.550 --> 13:12.930
But go too wild and you'll run out of steam, pony-boy!

13:13.430 --> 13:15.620
Self-Defense Force, move out!

13:24.090 --> 13:25.740
Let's keep moving.

13:33.820 --> 13:36.960
<i>"One cannot live without harming others."</i>

13:37.910 --> 13:39.710
<i>If that's the truth of our world...</i>

13:40.300 --> 13:41.910
<i>it's far too painful.</i>

13:46.740 --> 13:51.610
<i>Even so, I didn't want to lose any more friends from the Mud Whale.</i>

13:53.130 --> 13:54.440
<i>Never again.</i>

14:08.560 --> 14:10.160
Chakki!

14:10.160 --> 14:12.150
Great block!

14:12.150 --> 14:14.410
Looks like we can't call you destroyer anymore.

14:17.120 --> 14:20.190
Hurry, before they send reinforcements.

14:20.190 --> 14:20.960
Yeah!

14:22.230 --> 14:23.920
<i>My intuition wasn't wrong.</i>

14:24.920 --> 14:30.840
<i>The people of the Mud Whale all have stronger thymia than the imperial soldiers.</i>

14:35.000 --> 14:36.100
What happened?

14:36.100 --> 14:38.570
Master Suou, it's the Central Tower!

14:38.570 --> 14:42.650
The enemy blew open a hole and started coming in!

14:44.610 --> 14:45.650
I will go.

14:45.980 --> 14:46.990
What are you saying?

14:46.990 --> 14:47.970
But—

14:47.970 --> 14:50.490
The Chieftain must stay in the safest location!

14:50.920 --> 14:53.740
You are everyone's emotional support.

15:04.820 --> 15:08.360
If I am to be that support,
then now of all times must I go!

15:08.360 --> 15:08.880
Wait!

15:11.190 --> 15:13.850
Geez, you dummy!

15:37.300 --> 15:41.390
Run, children! Backup will be up here soon.

15:41.390 --> 15:42.590
Elder Hakuji...

15:42.590 --> 15:44.020
Go! Quickly!

15:45.050 --> 15:47.920
I won't allow you to harm the children!

15:48.870 --> 15:51.280
Begone, you devils!

16:12.280 --> 16:14.510
Elder Hakuji!

16:16.740 --> 16:18.490
Elder Hakuji!

16:23.150 --> 16:24.290
Elder Hakuji!

16:28.960 --> 16:30.930
Suou...

16:30.930 --> 16:33.180
Don't speak! I'll get a medic right away!

16:37.730 --> 16:47.110
It was... a mistake...
to try to sink... the island...

16:48.270 --> 16:55.490
I want... to see... your future...

16:56.710 --> 17:02.960
Even if... th-the world... despises you...

17:02.960 --> 17:13.590
I truly... cherish... the Mud Whale... and everyone on...

17:16.460 --> 17:17.920
My bad!

17:18.530 --> 17:21.350
Were you still talking?

17:21.350 --> 17:26.470
Though either way, that geezer was about to croak anyway.

17:30.100 --> 17:31.070
Be silent!

17:32.260 --> 17:34.990
You're acting pretty pompous.

17:34.990 --> 17:36.530
You mad?

17:43.620 --> 17:45.730
Gonna take revenge for him?

17:46.340 --> 17:47.960
Draw it already!

17:47.960 --> 17:49.270
Go on!

17:52.380 --> 17:57.840
I will not allow you to insult Elder Hakuji!

17:58.510 --> 17:59.800
That's good.

18:00.270 --> 18:03.430
I just love those eyes!

18:05.810 --> 18:08.240
Hey! What's wrong?!

18:08.240 --> 18:11.570
Go on and start being all pompous again!

18:21.130 --> 18:25.330
Come on... what's with those marionette eyes?

18:25.330 --> 18:28.830
I'm fed up with puppets, you know.

18:29.370 --> 18:32.590
Scream and cry some more, would you?

18:37.470 --> 18:42.140
I'm sick and tired of everyone acting like zombies!

18:44.910 --> 18:51.350
I'm not crazy! It's the world that's crazy!

18:51.350 --> 18:54.270
That's right, the world is crazy.

18:55.180 --> 18:58.530
But that guy happens to be my boss.

18:58.950 --> 19:00.950
Mind letting him alone?

19:01.280 --> 19:04.910
Oh, and by the way... you're more annoying than a mosquito.

19:16.030 --> 19:20.010
This is it. Beyond this door is the nous Skylos.

19:20.350 --> 19:24.420
But just like with Falaina,
you can't use thymia down here.

19:24.420 --> 19:26.850
Nobody's come after us this whole way.

19:26.850 --> 19:29.020
You're all great!

19:29.020 --> 19:32.350
We'll be able to pull this off exactly as we planned.

19:32.820 --> 19:35.730
Ouni's group will stay and use their thymia to guard the entrance.

19:35.730 --> 19:39.500
We'll follow Lykos and destroy the nous.

19:39.500 --> 19:40.200
Got it?

19:40.200 --> 19:41.860
Roger wilco!

19:41.860 --> 19:44.410
Lykos, be careful.

19:48.780 --> 19:50.260
Okay, let's go!

20:11.810 --> 20:13.590
It's stained glass art.

20:14.620 --> 20:15.970
It's pretty.

20:15.970 --> 20:17.590
Yeah...

20:18.550 --> 20:23.660
Nope! If you ask me, I think these are way more beautiful.

20:26.220 --> 20:27.610
Lead the way, hero!

20:27.610 --> 20:28.290
Ow!

20:28.850 --> 20:30.200
All right, follow me.

20:33.140 --> 20:34.270
<i>Something's off.</i>

20:35.010 --> 20:38.750
<i>We shouldn't be able to get this close to the nous unhindered.</i>

20:39.360 --> 20:41.630
<i>I don't sense anyone pursuing us either.</i>

20:42.460 --> 20:43.220
<i>Why?</i>

20:55.450 --> 20:56.230
Wait!

20:57.940 --> 20:59.650
Tokusa! Everyone!

21:00.400 --> 21:01.780
Wait, Urumi!

21:03.460 --> 21:05.410
Nibi, were you injured?

21:06.990 --> 21:08.160
Why didn't you say anything?

21:09.720 --> 21:12.870
Like I could admit I was the only one who screwed up.

21:13.270 --> 21:16.500
It'd be way too lame to force my way here only to hold you back.

21:16.900 --> 21:17.710
Don't be—

21:19.500 --> 21:21.160
It came from down the hall!

21:21.160 --> 21:22.130
Ouni!

21:22.130 --> 21:25.220
You're hurt, so stay here.

21:25.220 --> 21:25.840
Chakki!

21:30.760 --> 21:32.560
Will you be okay, Ginshu?

21:32.560 --> 21:34.640
That's Big Sis!

21:34.640 --> 21:37.290
We can't just leave the door wide open.

21:37.290 --> 21:39.310
I won't let a single person by!

21:41.440 --> 21:47.160
<i>I can only leave behind records of a fraction of what happened.</i>

21:50.610 --> 21:53.200
<i>The world that people saw last...</i>

21:55.860 --> 21:58.300
<i>The world reflected in their eyes...</i>

22:01.090 --> 22:02.280
<i>Just how...</i>

22:04.340 --> 22:06.840
<i>am I supposed to convey it?</i>
